    {
      "key": "NurseryPlanPanel.041",
      "sourceEnglish": "Nursery survival is the share of germinated seedlings that remain usable at transplanting. This model assumes one seed is sown per cell and one transplant is taken from each successful cell.",
      "sourceSha256": "154871dc96288f57da6205dc0fbee71d1bdc0d6db11f2d75feea25ca4cb03c8f",
      "text": "Kunusurika kitaluni ni asilimia ya miche iliyoota ambayo inabaki kuwa bora kwa kupandikizwa. Mfumo huu unakadiria mbegu moja inapandwa kwa kila chembe na mche mmoja unapatikana kutoka kwa kila chembe iliyofaulu.",
      "review": {
        "status": "unreviewed"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "NurseryPlanPanel.042",
      "sourceEnglish": "Your usable starts per tray",
      "sourceSha256": "4c15d5fb99ba6ea13b5025ebad5c8bf004a8359c3cb8c426efaf10464a59f602",
      "text": "Miche yako inayotumika kwa kila trei",
      "review": {
        "status": "unreviewed"
      }
    },
    {
