      "sourceSha256": "f1c14c6b33239598867fcef4e2981243d99c8bb744e2efe2c0f93719570a28bb",
      "text": "Mbegu zako zilizopandwa kwa kila trei (si lazima)",
      "review": {
        "status": "unreviewed"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "NurseryPlanPanel.044",
      "sourceEnglish": "Use your observed usable seedling output for a tray, including nursery losses. Suitable for your multi-sown or pricked-out method; no extra germination or nursery-loss allowance is applied.",
      "sourceSha256": "b98b6639466a7d36eb542a6a4ba1fcb72ce9b06da9a0632d89e8a82e5361166a",
      "text": "Tumia idadi halisi ya miche inayotumika uliyoshuhudia kutoka kwa trei, ikiwa ni pamoja na miche iliyoharibika kitaluni. Inafaa kwa mbinu yako ya kupanda mbegu nyingi pamoja au kupandikiza mapema; hakuna makadirio ya ziada ya uotaji au hasara ya kitaluni yanayoongezwa.",
      "review": {
        "status": "unreviewed"
      }
    },
