    },
    {
      "key": "NurseryPlanPanel.047",
      "sourceEnglish": "Field survival is separate from nursery losses. Blank applies no extra field allowance. Entering 0% keeps the observation but cannot produce a finite planting requirement.",
      "sourceSha256": "1577ad9fc24eff96a7276b18557d9624591e61d8142f7c555370ab006a9e3598",
      "text": "Kunusurika shambani ni tofauti na hasara za kitaluni. Kuacha wazi hakutaongeza makadirio ya ziada ya shambani. Kuweka 0% kunahifadhi kumbukumbu lakini hakuwezi kutoa hesabu kamili ya mahitaji ya upandaji.",
